Subject: [PATCH] ath12k: recover the full group with one reset owner

Close every member before draining old producers. Retain non-MLO memory,
detach all MLO borrowers, rebuild QMI peers by lookup instance generation,
and wait for group READY and mac80211 business completion. Keep failed
DMA and in-flight reconfiguration obligations explicit for final removal.

